    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534070/extras/d9a0e5ac046332f057f11a4a85d402d0.poster.avif?t=1754252031\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534070/extras/d9a0e5ac046332f057f11a4a85d402d0.webp?t=1754252031\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=458 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to exorSYS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After unknowingly upgrading to a cursed operating system, you must follow a breadcrumb of previous victims in order to uncover the truth before you inevitably become a victim yourself. Solve puzzles, dig for secrets, hack computers, and use  special programs to help advance from level to level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >exorSYS Report Panel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534070/extras/0a2b14550d18c00042bc13cd0f55405a.poster.avif?t=1754252031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534070/extras/0a2b14550d18c00042bc13cd0f55405a.webm?t=1754252031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Something </i>is trying to keep you out. Use the included <u><strong>exorSYS Report Panel</strong></u> when connecting to hacking into another computer to report anything strange. Pay close attention to your environment for anything out of the ordinary. It can be something simple like a displaced or missing object. Sometimes it's far worse. Stave off suspicious activity long enough to successfully complete the hack.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Object Moved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Object Missing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra Object</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Pazuzu</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Object Changed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And other <i>strange</i> occurrences</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Desktop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534070/extras/3cc01c92de4a885263f92f9bd8a310a8.avif?t=1754252031\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the included programs to access new information. You have a variety of interesting applications at your disposal. Any new information acquired from levels will appear on your desktop for you to view and interact with including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emails</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ciphers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pay close attention</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are decoding a clue on your desktop or looking for missing objects in a museum, pay close attention to your surroundings and dig deep. <i>Anything</i> could be a clue, so don't be so quick to rule anything out. Even this page that your reading <i>right now</i> could be a clue. Maybe in the pictures?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534070/extras/d9a0e5ac046332f057f11a4a85d402d0.poster.avif?t=1754252031\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534070/extras/d9a0e5ac046332f057f11a4a85d402d0.webp?t=1754252031\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=458 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to exorSYS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After unknowingly upgrading to a cursed operating system, you must follow a breadcrumb of previous victims in order to uncover the truth before you inevitably become a victim yourself. Solve puzzles, dig for secrets, hack computers, and use  special programs to help advance from level to level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >exorSYS Report Panel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534070/extras/0a2b14550d18c00042bc13cd0f55405a.poster.avif?t=1754252031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534070/extras/0a2b14550d18c00042bc13cd0f55405a.webm?t=1754252031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Something </i>is trying to keep you out. Use the included <u><strong>exorSYS Report Panel</strong></u> when connecting to hacking into another computer to report anything strange. Pay close attention to your environment for anything out of the ordinary. It can be something simple like a displaced or missing object. Sometimes it's far worse. Stave off suspicious activity long enough to successfully complete the hack.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Object Moved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Object Missing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra Object</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Pazuzu</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Object Changed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And other <i>strange</i> occurrences</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Desktop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534070/extras/3cc01c92de4a885263f92f9bd8a310a8.avif?t=1754252031\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the included programs to access new information. You have a variety of interesting applications at your disposal. Any new information acquired from levels will appear on your desktop for you to view and interact with including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emails</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ciphers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pay close attention</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are decoding a clue on your desktop or looking for missing objects in a museum, pay close attention to your surroundings and dig deep. <i>Anything</i> could be a clue, so don't be so quick to rule anything out. Even this page that your reading <i>right now</i> could be a clue. Maybe in the pictures?</p>",
